   "evidence": "`grep -n '@\\[(simp, )?grind' EpsilonEridani/` returns exactly lines 220, 290, 323, 341 of this file; lines 187\u2013204 and 274\u2013310 show the value and base-case lemmas tagged `@[simp]` only.",
